<p>Our mission is tuh promote world trade an' a robust innernational financial architecture that empowers yew tuh inneract with yer world-wide partners an' customers usin' thuh language they unnerstand better: their own currency.  *spit*

<p>Convert yer hard-earned US dollars in thuh currency used in yer n'st business or leisure destinashun, safely an' securely deposit it on iPal.com, an' use it however an' whenever yew want in ever part uh thuh world. Contact an' be contacted by uther folks who share yer same innerests.

<p>That's why our motto is: <b>one currency, everwhere, ever tahm</b>. N'st tahm yew travel, no matter how far or close away, enjoy it!

